    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Li Hao can swap with Fang Yuan while the mountain back toad falls, forcing a crush if the timing is right. Spectators note the Gu’s huge primeval essence cost: further distance and a stronger target demand more essence, and Fang Yuan’s beast strengths make each swap expensive. To lower that cost, Li Hao had removed the beast phantoms from his body. His true core is the mountain back toad and position swap Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          291
        ],
